<title>USA: Louisville feeder cattle steady-up $2 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Louisville feeder cattle steady-up $2 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>LOUISVILLE 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Feeder steers and heifers were steady to $2.00 per cwt higher, compared to last week's close, USDA said.</p>
<p>Feeder Steers - Medium and Large 1 600- 700 lbs</p>
<p>68.25-75.50, few black 76.00; 700-800 lbs 60.50-67.00; 800-900 lbs 60.00-65.00. Medium and Large 2 600-700 lbs 60.00-65.50.</p>
<p>Holsteins - Large 2 500-600 lbs 53.25-54.50; package 618 lbs 49.25.</p>
<p>Feeder Heifers - Medium and Large 1 600-700 lbs 61.00- 66.50; 700-800 lbs 54.00-61.95. Medium and Large 2 500- 600 lbs 54.00-62.00.</p>
<p>Cattle and Calves Receipts - 2,200</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
